### Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

###

### Create Task
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Backend Project Verification",
  "description": "Manual testing using REST Client",
  "priority": "high",
  "due_date": "2026-08-15"
}

###

### Get All Tasks
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/tasks

###

### Get Tasks - Filtered + Paginated + Sorted
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/tasks?status=pending&priority=high&page=1&limit=10&sortBy=due_date&order=asc

###

### Get Task By ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/tasks/1

###

### Full Update (PUT) - all editable fields required
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Backend Project Verification",
  "description": "Updated successfully",
  "status": "in_progress",
  "priority": "medium",
  "due_date": null,
  "completed": false
}

###

### Partial Update (PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v1/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "completed": true
}

###

### Delete Task
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/tasks/1

###

### Invalid Body - missing title
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Missing title"
}

###

### Invalid Body - contradictory status/completed
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Contradiction example",
  "status": "pending",
  "completed": true
}

###

### Invalid ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/tasks/abc

###

### Missing Resource
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/tasks/999999

###

### Empty PATCH body (should be rejected)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v1/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{}
